adopt the procedure similar to which laid down under Order 21 Rule41 CPC - namely to examine the iudgement debtor to disclose hisproperty and produce its property card, failirg which he can be sent tojail for 3 months.
5) Amount to be refunded:
Refund of the principal amount of Rs. 15,86,400/- along with interest at'10,25o/o p, a. till full refund of the amount to the complainant by therespondent and a cost of Rs. 10,000/- payable to the cornplainant.
6) Enclosures:i) Final order dated 1.8th February 2020.ii) Order of Non-compliance dated 4t fuly 2023-iii) Calculation submitted by the complainant.
(Dr. Vasant Prabhu)
MumbaiDate: 18th July 2023
SecretaryMahaRERA, Mumbai

